    <p>Data quality and retailer compliance are evaluated by measuring the lag between <code>source_updated_at</code> (when the retailer set the price) and <code>recorded_at</code> (when the observation was logged). The overall median update lag across all records is <strong>{overall_median_lag:.1f} hours</strong>.</p>

    <div class="chart-container">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64,{img_lag_dist}" alt="Update Lag Distribution">
