        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="chart-container">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64,{img_coverage}" alt="Station Coverage Bar Chart">
        <p><em>Figure 3: Total count of unique forecourts reporting prices for each respective fuel type.</em></p>
    </div>

